# Determining the Effectiveness of Retrieval Algorithms.

**Authors:** Frei, H. P., Schauble, P.

## Abstract
Describes a new effectiveness measure as an alternative to the traditional evaluation measures of recall and precision in information retrieval systems. The statistical approach--which compares two retrieval algorithms--is explained, the information needs of the user are considered, and an experiment with a test collection of abstracts is discussed. (14 references) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ427512

